e broad definition encompasses a set of autonomous processing modules interconnected by a communication system, highlighting the distributed nature of modern computing [Data: Entities (670), Relationships (3115)].\\n\\nThe interconnected nature of computer networks makes them a foundational element of contemporary technology, impacting everything from personal communication to industrial operations. Their complexity and reach contribute significantly to their overall importance within the digital landscape.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Key Components and Their Roles in Network Functionality\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Several components are crucial for the functioning of computer networks. 'GATEWAYS' act as essential bridges, connecting networks that use different communication protocols and serving as translation points for heterogeneous systems [Data: Entities (550)]. These are often integrated with 'SISTEMAS LEGAIS', or legacy systems, to facilitate their integration with newer platforms [Data: Relationships (674)].\\n\\n'COMUTADOR DE PAQUETES (SWITCH)' devices are fundamental for forwarding data packets between network segments. They receive data packets, examine destination addresses, and efficiently route them to the correct ports, connecting multiple devices within a local network and reducing network collisions [Data: Entities (2275), Relationships (826, 3117)]. Similarly, 'COMUTADOR DE PAQUETES' is a broader term for devices that forward data packets between network segments [Data: Entities (2284)].\\n\\n'ENLACE DE COMUNICAÇÃO', or communication links, represent the physical or logical connections that link devices within a network, enabling data transmission. These can be wired (cables, fiber optics) or wireless [Data: Entities (2274)]. Both switches and communication links are categorized as 'COMPUTER NETWORK COMPONENT's, underscoring their role as fundamental building blocks [Data: Relationships (3116, 3117)].\\n\\n'MÓDULO 